# Dividing the smallest `long` (`i64::MIN`) by `-1` overflows `long` (DS4003).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| extend x = (tolong(amount) * 0 - 9223372036854775807 - 1) / -1
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `/` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:3:14
  |
3 | | extend x = (tolong(amount) * 0 - 9223372036854775807 - 1) / -1
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
